WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.168
By the end of this module you should be able to
create standard views inspect

00:00:04.195 --> 00:00:09.063
their definitions and dependencies explain when a
view is updatable and use a check option

00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:15.013
to control writes through a filtered view You should
also understand materialized-view

00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:20.052
freshness and be able to decide whether logic
belongs in a statement-level CTE a reusable

00:00:20.078 --> 00:00:22.868
standard view or a stored materialized result
